exit 0
--- stdout
A device is its hardware's ref, hardware/PLUGIN/ID, such as hardware/hue/0x2, as
oikade list devices shows it. Its line in your code names the same hardware, as
hue/0x2.

Commands that take a device
  list devices                What's on record, and how each is set up.
  status hardware/PLUGIN/ID   What it's doing now, why, and its last 10 events.
  history hardware/PLUGIN/ID  What it did, and who wrote to it.
  tail hardware/PLUGIN/ID     What it does, as it happens.
  forget hardware/PLUGIN/ID   Drop it from the host's record, and end its
                              claims.

oikade help COMMAND says more of one.
--- stderr
